Any description of emotions that uses things other than UI is merely an=20
approximation. Saying "I'm happy" is not the same thing as smiling for=20
example. You can use SEI to create ad-hoc "UI" though, just like you=20
wanted. It's just that "ui" and "sei mi gleki" aren't exactly identical,=20
the latter is at most a means of paraphrasing an emotion.

